@RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230

### Best 10 stories by score
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=10
Accept: application/json

### Just the single best story
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=1
Accept: application/json

### Everything Hacker News lists (up to 500)
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=500
Accept: application/json

### 400 - n must be at least 1
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=0
Accept: application/json

### 400 - n must be an integer
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=abc
Accept: application/json

### 400 - n is required
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best
Accept: application/json

### 405 - only GET (and HEAD) are allowed
POST {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/api/stories/best?n=1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Liveness
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/health

### Readiness (503 until the first snapshot is loaded, "Degraded" when stale)
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{RestfulAPIDemo_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
